<title>FRANCE: Bank of France to outline 97 objectives on Dec 17.</title>
<headline>Bank of France to outline 97 objectives on Dec 17.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet will outline the central bank's monetary policy objectives for 1997 at a regular annual news conference at 1330 GMT on December 17, the Bank of France said on Monday.</p>
<p>The news conference will take place after a meeting of the central bank's monetary policy council.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
